# CODEOWNERS — auto-assigns reviewers based on what files changed.
# When a PR touches a matching path, GitHub requests review from these users/teams.
# Use this to enforce expert review on security-sensitive code.

# Default owners for everything
*       @your-username

# Security-sensitive files need security team review
/.github/workflows/    @your-username
/.github/dependabot.yml @your-username
/pyproject.toml        @your-username
/uv.lock               @your-username
/Dockerfile            @your-username
/docker-compose*.yml   @your-username
/.env.example          @your-username

# AI-specific code needs ML/AI review
/brain/                @your-username
/agents/               @your-username
/skills/               @your-username
/.skills/              @your-username
/tests/ai_evals/       @your-username

# Production deployment files
/release.yml            @your-username
/infra/                 @your-username
